      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '"Where am I? I have a bad feeling about this.



    Why am I covered
    in this goo? Don''t tell me I just came out of this cocoon."



    Disemboied
    voice:  "The transfiguration has ceased. Seize the subject."



    "Who are
    you? Get out of my head!



    I must find a way out before they find me!"'
