--- !u!114 &4269179155973562051
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7750570994022068200}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f37d456f0635af049bd41c0a4c505920, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  RandomLines1:
  - What is this place? I don't remember any of this.
  - Where am I? I have a bad feeling about this.
  - Is this my body? It doesn't feel like it used to.
  - Who am I? I feel sick and strange.
  RandomLines2:
  - Why am I covered in this goo? Don't tell me I just came out of this cocoon.
  - What happened to me? Uuugghhh, this is very sticky... and stinks.
  - How did I get in there? This is so wrong.
  RandomLines3:
  - 'Disemboied voice: Subject, you are unqualified. You must yield.'
  - 'Disemboied voice: Reunite with me to conclude the process. You are still defective.'
  - 'Disemboied voice: You won''t outlast. Subject, submit to prevent your demise.'
  - 'Disemboied voice: The subject is misplaced, reinstate immediatly.'
  - 'Disemboied voice: The transfiguration has ceased. Seize the subject.'
  RandomLines4:
  - Who are you? Get out of my head!
  - How are you doing that? What are you?
  - Are you talking to me?
  RandomLines5:
  - I must find a way out before they find me!
  RandomLines6:
  - (Use the joytick to move and jump button to move over the environment)
